ion. Upcoming substantive manifest should use schema3 and disclose timing honestly. No proof rerun solely to manufacture chronology.\",\n+  \"protocol_transport\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\proof-digestion-protocol.md\",\n+      \"current_RAW\": \"8a183dde41c2b58f5c6a6e2fa4158ccc64ad3e427b9349110d15141aed254492\",\n+      \"premerge_snapshot_RAW\": \"08c017891f2a7e5f93bb76e8e5288a8a9436a8e34a44676938d4abeb82300a73\",\n+      \"CRLF_normalized_text_equal\": true,\n+      \"raw_equal\": false\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md\",\n+      \"current_RAW\": \"9e529672bb9706b245596e272024d4b38f3e5a32a5b54310ac70aa8d2118ccf7\",\n+      \"premerge_snapshot_RAW\": \"810e407dec8494cd47d1f94477a241ccc578136d69c36a410deae01a36d69ade\",\n+      \"CRLF_normalized_text_equal\": true,\n+      \"raw_equal\": false\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"protocol_transport_note\": \"Initial local audit exact-byte comparison stopped before writing because current checkout CRLF differs from preserved upstream LF. Exact separate RAW hashes retained; CRLF-normalized text equality verified. No file edits or blanket RAW-equality claim.\",\n+  \"verified_implementation_routes\": 1,\n+  \"source_route\": \"Author global-support/constrained optimality justification remains unresolved SOURCE_GAP, not second verified sufficient OR route. Alternative proximal/segment route does not repair that author claim.\",\n+  \"common_blind_spots_checked\": [\n+    \"Explicit feasible attained hmin; no universal existence/total selector/None recovery.\",\n+    \"Global no-bottom, finite feasible EReal values and global supports retained; no silent real-only/affine/Lipschitz restriction.\",\n+    \"Whole current loss precedes choice/payment x(t+1); stronger oracle than OGD is explicit.\",\n+    \"SAME canonical Option run and supplied trajectory; both production conjuncts actually used in canaries and numeric bound specialized from same all-u result.\",\n+    \"Ordered divergence half factors, negative movement squares, maxprevious excluding terminal, last used eta; fixedT0 without empty max.\",\n+    \"Hilbert geometry extension distinct finite-dimensional source consumers; fixed exercise mandatory. Sourcegap/B4 and7containers+6futureclaims open.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"learning_failure_class\": {\n+    \"current_recovered_route\": \"NONE may denote current successful verified implementation only.\",\n+    \"history\": \"Two core and one canary IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED attempts preserved. Packaging selfhash and GBK errors are process evidence, not negative mathematics.\",\n+    \"salvage\": \"Successful shared geometry/endpoints and selector compositions retained/reviewed. No failed fragment promoted by text alone; historical snapshots retained, no cleanup authorized.\",\n+    \"source_delta\": \"Author unresolved source justification is not REFUTED or SOURCE_INVALID; do not erase it under NONE.\"\n+  },\n+  \"next_requirements\": [\n+    \"Schema3 binds actual statement/binder/source topology/proof digestion/learning/purification records and this chronology.\",\n+    \"Fresh root/Tests/full harness/contributor/site/registry/personal visual gates after current-main integration.\",\n+    \"No Exposition Seal/PURIFIED until separately evidenced; no package/chapter/Goal/main/live/nativewholeloop acceptance.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"input_refs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\proof-digestion-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"8a183dde41c2b58f5c6a6e2fa4158ccc64ad3e427b9349110d15141aed254492\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"docs\\\\evidence-routed-memory-protocol.md\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"9e529672bb9706b245596e272024d4b38f3e5a32a5b54310ac70aa8d2118ccf7\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"runs\\\\process_memory.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"d85256d30393b733554a040c0f5fb729e70639e6734fc775ef0e920089a0c578\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"BanditRLProof\\\\OnlinePrescientEuclidean.lean\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"9b755a12d540c1039b068e4b9