0,\n+      \"capture_integrity_ok\": true,\n+      \"RAW_count\": 1322,\n+      \"ZIP_count\": 1315\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"gate\": \"site-preflight-v2\",\n+      \"receipt_sha256\": \"3f923ab5a3857b3765c794c0872b69085654f0cb0479243fe75cb158de276906\",\n+      \"actual_exit\": 0,\n+      \"capture_integrity_ok\": true,\n+      \"RAW_count\": 1322,\n+      \"ZIP_count\": 1315\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"gate\": \"structural-v1\",\n+      \"receipt_sha256\": \"3db432f3ebfa0fece31897d85d25e58a8b60868452fbbba1a399c903efbdaf21\",\n+      \"actual_exit\": 0,\n+      \"capture_integrity_ok\": true,\n+      \"RAW_count\": 1322,\n+      \"ZIP_count\": 1315\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"gate_findings\": \"All eight actual0/integritytrue with clean identical candidate HEAD before/after. Independently re-enumerated all1322 current active RAW inputs for EACH receipt and verified all1315 selected ZIP entries, manifest/path-set equality, original stdout/stderr hashes and all five governance bytes. ZIP is selected evidence, not entire archive. No gate rerun by reviewer.\",\n+  \"combined_log_findings\": {\n+    \"root_jobs\": 9123,\n+    \"Tests_jobs\": 9305,\n+    \"ProofGraphExport\": \"actual harness step retained\",\n+    \"unit_tests\": 474,\n+    \"seconds\": 222.406,\n+    \"skipped\": 7,\n+    \"final_marker\": \"check passed\"\n+  },\n+  \"contributor_findings\": \"Actual nonempty comparison to8045070:441 changed paths,19 affected production paths,3 changed contribution contracts; explicit Contributor contract passed and coverage includes current core/root/three reader files and imported governance.\",\n+  \"port_findings\": \"All91 rows exact original-to-port bytes and manifestSHA verified; original tmp execution paths retained. No contemporaneous canonical RUN capture claim. No gzip derivation used in this port.\",\n+  \"proof_and_source_findings\": [\n+    \"Prior independent three-core and two-complete-canary BODY reviews reused only with exact unchanged source/frozen hashes. All55core and53canary evidence-manifest items rehashed, including failed attempts and actual compiler/probe/TYPEVALUE outputs.\",\n+    \"Three frozen core APIs: actual quadratic gradient/divergence and same Option-run variable/fixed full signed source bounds. Two complete finite-domain nonaffine EReal canaries consume both new conclusions and derive numeric endpoints from the same bound.\",\n+    \"Five axiom exports standard propext/Classical.choice/Quot.sound only, scoped native fences/header equality accepted; no custom axiom or native whole-loop claim.\",\n+    \"Source topologyV2 23nodes and source optimality unresolved gap remain distinct from selected TYPE/VALUE occurrences. Only one verified proximal/segment implementation route; original author support argument is not silently certified.\",\n+    \"T>0 variable maximum excludes terminal; fixedT0 permitted; correct new-state score and half-squared negative movement; hmin is attained valid-run premise, no universal existence or None recovery.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"historical_failure_preservation\": [\n+    \"Two production IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED attempts and one Test attempt retained with snapshots/streams.\",\n+    \"False selfhash manifest-v1 retained alongside correctedv2 and packaging disclosure.\",\n+    \"GBK tooling failure retained without mathematical inference.\",\n+    \"Actual site-preflight-v1 failed on three external Mathlib registry names. Reviewed one-field repair638be7f1 keeps names in lean_notes/VALUE and empties only project navigation dependencies.\",\n+    \"Original schema3 namespace error and exact single-field successor retained; current failure_class NONE describes recovered candidate, not erasure of route failures.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"integration_findings\": {\n+    \"old_complete_registry_objects_preserved\": 11101,\n+    \"new_registry_nodes\": 3,\n+    \"registry_total\": 11104,\n+    \"old_source_cards_preserved\": 21,\n+    \"source_cards_now\": 22,\n+    \"new_highlights\": 3,\n+    \"all_other_parsed_content_objects_unchanged\": true,\n+    \"geometry_external_VALUE_parents_preserved\": true\n+  },\n+  \"personal_pixel_review\": {\n+    \"all_eight_original_images_personally_viewed\": true,\n+    \"images\": [\n+      {\n+        \"file\": \"source-card-v1.png\",\n+        \"sha256\": \"af9d67a7daabf67bef956dd9730518502c10ad1b819ec8c96e9efb9bca0df27b\",\n+        \"geometry\": {\n+          \"left\": 343.390625,\n+          \"right\": 1400.609375,\n+          \"top\": 179.765625,\n+          \"bottom\": 1577.0625,\n+          \"height\": 1397.296875,\n+          \"scrollWidth\": 1057,\n+          \"clientWidth\": 1057,\n+          \"viewportWidth\": 1440,\n+          \"viewportHeight\": 1800\n+        }\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"file\": \"lesson-quadratic_geometry-v1.png\",\n+        \"sha256\": \"660a4e734e9f015e5de00005b14e9ffc72580c6c30de63c10a3f24106a2462d9\",\n+        \"geometry\": {\n+          \"left\": 357.78125,\n+          \"right\": 1386.21875,\n+          \"top\": 179.921875,\n+          \"bottom\": 1632.375,\n+          \"height\": 1452.453125,\n+          \"scrollWidth\": 1026,\n+          \"clientWidth\": 1026,\n+          \"viewportWidth\": 1440,\n+          \"viewportHeight\": 1853\n+        }\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"file\": \"lesson-euclidean_variable_regret-v1.png\",\n+        \"sha256\": \"675948b4495f641682d5073c2fc37e23562f85b4970e5eefe4d6425b43f3e2cd\",\n+        \"geometry\": {\n+          \"left\": 357.78125,\n+          \"right\": 1386.21875,\n+          \"top\": 180.171875,\n+          \"bottom\": 2098.359375,\n+          \"height\": 1918.1875,\n+          \"scrollWidth\": 1026,\n+          \"clientWidth\": 1026,\n+          \"viewportWidth\": 1440,\n+          \"viewportHeight\": 2319\n+        }\n+      },\n+      {\n+        \"file\": \"lesson-euclidean_fixed_regret-v1.png\",\n+        \"sha256\": \"7e7f2ef4f05c28166e637945e2067f72f1264bf7be1e86c0ac37d6bcc5c4debf\",\n+        \"geometry\": {\n+        